#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for restaurants, bistros, cafés and bars. Ships lunch and dinner menu layouts with prices, a reservation panel, opening hours, chef profiles, events, a filterable gallery and review carousels — eight colour palettes, three type pairings and full-site editing throughout. Works with any form plugin, or on its own."
msgstr ""

